        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "NoLoc - The air is thick with intense magical warmth around the staff, as it channels the Scarlet Lady\u2019s power. You reach through the scorching heat, and with a yell, manage to yank it free, severing the connection!  New Sirocco is safe!",
                "_meta": "RemoveEndStaff_CA_00"
            },
            "_actorName": "name_unpc_narrator",
            "_actorParameterID": "eaff42b8-2e6f-407a-a7ee-377ae2c7c285",
            "_position": {
                "x": 4985.0,
                "y": 2114.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
            "$id": "25"
        },
        {
            "_action": {
                "Sound": "CS_ScarletteEmissary_Voice_04",
                "TransPos": {},
                "overrideAgent": {
                    "_name": "gInstigator",
                    "_targetVariableID": "6c7ad705-fd66-469d-974a-b695c2e70211"
                },
                "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.PlaySound"
            },
            "_position": {
                "x": 5039.0,
                "y": 2233.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
            "$id": "27"
        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "NoLoc - Hmph. After all my work of adding the bloodline of Sirocco\u2019s Chamberlords to my own, they disappoint me and die. Again, it seems the only true power is in the blood of the oldest families.",
                "_meta": "ScarletLady_CA_ScarletFinal_Dungeon_18"
            },
            "_actorName": "name_unpc_RedLichIdol_01",
            "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
            "_position": {
                "x": 4919.0,
                "y": 2339.0
            },
            "_UID": "2ec8f6bc-ab8f-475e-9580-6234666e626f",
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
            "$id": "31"
        },
        {
            "_action": {
                "Sound": "CS_ScarletteEmissary_Voice_01",
                "TransPos": {},
                "overrideAgent": {
                    "_name": "gInstigator",
                    "_targetVariableID": "6c7ad705-fd66-469d-974a-b695c2e70211"
                },
                "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.PlaySound"
            },
            "_position": {
                "x": 4932.0,
                "y": 2460.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
            "$id": "33"
        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "NoLoc - Very well, my plans will be adjusted. I suppose I should thank you for revealing my weaknesses to me, [PlayerName]. It makes my eventual victory all the more certain.",
                "_meta": "ScarletLady_CA_ScarletFinal_Dungeon_19"
            },
            "_actorName": "name_unpc_RedLichIdol_01",
            "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
            "_position": {
                "x": 4871.0,
                "y": 2565.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
            "$id": "37"
        },
        {
            "availableChoices": [
                {
                    "statement": {
                        "_text": "no loc - Underestimate humanity at your peril, Scarlet Lady. We can clearly match you!",
                        "_meta": "ScarletLady_CA_ScarletFinal_Dungeon_19_a"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "_position": {
                "x": 4814.0,
                "y": 2683.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
            "$id": "39"
        },
        {
            "_action": {
                "Sound": "CS_ScarletteEmissary_Voice_02",
                "TransPos": {},
                "overrideAgent": {
                    "_name": "gInstigator",
                    "_targetVariableID": "6c7ad705-fd66-469d-974a-b695c2e70211"
                },
                "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.PlaySound"
            },
            "_position": {
                "x": 5015.0,
                "y": 2825.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
            "$id": "43"
        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "NoLoc - How quaint.  People die, systems collapse, societies crumble.  The only constant is the power of the blood, the power of wisdom and nobility, passed down through generations. Go on, treasure your victory today. It, like all mortal things, is transitory.",
                "_meta": "ScarletLady_CA_ScarletFinal_Dungeon_20"
            },
            "_actorName": "LOC KEY HERE",
            "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
            "_position": {
                "x": 4961.0,
                "y": 2912.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
            "$id": "47"
        },
        {
            "_action": {
                "Sound": "CS_ScarletteEmissary_Voice_01",
                "TransPos": {},
                "overrideAgent": {
                    "_name": "gInstigator",
                    "_targetVariableID": "6c7ad705-fd66-469d-974a-b695c2e70211"
                },
                "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.PlaySound"
            },
            "_position": {
                "x": 5072.0,
                "y": 3048.0
            },
            "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
            "$id": "49"
        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "NoLoc - Know this, human, my exile is temporary as well.  Someday Aurai will witness my presence again, and I will cease to be a mere myth. Someday, I will return to the throne I deserve, and bring my ideals into reality.",
                "_meta": "ScarletLady_CA_ScarletFinal_Dungeon_21"
            },
            "_actorName": "name_unpc_RedLichIdol_01",
            "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
            "_position": {
                "x": 5040.0,
